+"""A /loop tick must not stop the loop on a MACHINE interrupt [bd-dre-df78a].
+
+Same defect as the goal loop, same fix: ``_last_turn_interrupted`` is True for a
+provider stall or a stream abort as well as for a real Ctrl+C, and pausing a
+recurring loop on a transient silently ends it.
+"""
+
