+    "ArchiveHub upload needed to obtain contest results is still pending.",
+    "The agent reports the submission is upload-ready but final contest "
+    "upload is blocked pending ArchiveHub login from the owner.",
+    "The agent reports no executable lanes or watchers and is blocked on "
